	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["3AB0402B19DD5BA8"]
			description: [
				"You might notice that these hulls can be made more cheaply in an &3Assembler&r, but you don't have that weird fluid. Don't worry, you'll be able to make that soon."
				""
				"&bMV&r-tiered singleblocks, which you will unlock soon, also operate at &bMV&r recipe tier, but they don't automatically &atransform&r &7LV&r amps to &bMV&r power."
			]
			id: "5C4E189A3E401566"
			rewards: [{
				id: "09F16C5C9CFFEF84"
				item: "kubejs:moni_quarter"
				type: "item"
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 2.0d
			subtitle: "Your first MV hull marks the start of your transition into MV."
			tasks: [{
				id: "3F0884D8F0926142"
				item: "gtceu:mv_machine_hull"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&2MV Machine Hulls"
			x: 7.0d
			y: -7.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"5C4E189A3E401566"
				"2A11706D3D63925C"
			]
			description: [
				"Keep the MV area separate from your LV area. &eHooking up an LV machine to MV current will result in the machine being destroyed, and LV cables will burn up if you put MV current through them&r."
				""
				"Once you're comfortable and confident with voltages, you can use transformers to switch voltages within a single setup, but don't feel forced to try that until you've got a grasp on the basics."
				""
				"For your MV cables, you can use &6Copper&r to start with. &6Energetic Alloy cables&r are lossless though, so consider them if you're able to mass produce those ingots."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"By contrast, &aall RF power&r is lossless, and any RF supplier can send energy to any RF receiver without consequence. This means you can use Pipez or LaserIO to route power from wherever you're generating it to an &3Energy Converter&r for each tier of GregTech machine you have."
				""
				"That kind of setup is the most foolproof one for a beginner, but be warned: &cEnergy Converters only go up to HV&r. You &lwill&r have to get accustomed to GregTech power transfer in order to deal with larger quantities of power."
			]
			hide_until_deps_visible: true
			icon: "gtceu:mv_4a_energy_converter"
			id: "0B62AD25CDD86A6B"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
