			dependency_requirement: "one_completed"
			description: [
				"&6Chromium&r is used in the production of many alloys. &6Stainless Steel&r, &6Vanadium Steel&r, and &6Kanthal&r are the ones you will encounter soon. "
				""
				"There are several ways to get this stuff:\n1. Electrolyze &6Ruby Dust&r.\n2. Process &6Ruby Ore&r for a small chance to get Chromium.\n3. Mix and centrifuge &9Gem Slurries&r. These can also provide &6Manganese&r.\n4. Mine &6Chromite&r in The End.\nYou will need a lot of this soon, so be sure to accumulate a lot of it."
			]
